WEBVTT

00:03:59.516 --> 00:04:03.836
grasslands, peatlands, mangroves,

00:04:03.836 --> 00:04:05.956
kelp forests

00:04:05.956 --> 00:04:09.836
and healthy oceans are the best
and most efficient technologies

00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:12.196
to remove carbon from the atmosphere,

00:04:12.236 --> 00:04:14.076
and they already exist.

00:04:14.436 --> 00:04:16.676
As long as we protect them,

00:04:16.716 --> 00:04:19.236
they do the removal for free.

00:04:21.596 --> 00:04:23.716
The more biodiversity there is,

00:04:23.756 --> 00:04:26.236
the more carbon pollution it can absorb,

00:04:26.276 --> 00:04:29.076
the more it can help
stabilize the climate.